Error [jet.StateSectionNotAllowed]: `state { … }` is not valid inside a enum
  --> tests/ui/e0158_state_section_on_enum.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     state { Open }
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: State sections attach only to named struct bodies; enums, traits, aliases, impls, modules, and anonymous shapes have no state-set owner
 Fix: Move `state { … }` into the named struct body
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0158
